{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "5929c8a4153777e13480efdd57d0a69209118c3e57aaced40abf43d993ab36e9", "ja": "でもでも、見てない人にもオススメしたいな。\n私が、あらすじを面白く話せれば……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fee8e3978ba52ce4b5eeceabc2f0a01a4e80523452b1a3cba72dfda22ec9dde9", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nなにか調べ物ですか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "9a72dcbf8e46ec1afe858ebac68afc284c1143cc082886868087bff9ed6d87f8", "ja": "あっ！　お疲れさまです、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "048987c6991f0b41090af924d7285d117726e87fd4bb9c5955aee55bba5e2b05", "ja": "実は昨夜、ネトスワの新作ドラマを\n一気見しちゃったんですけど……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "6ec6aaf6815791ca6b138a2dc436a6834bc1845eba21473462432364ecf62060", "ja": "それが、すっ……ごく面白かったんです！\nせっかくだから、他の人にもオススメしたくて……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "95cd707a0a40ab651a47e82a27e704e19806f61c4dcd11448e3bff0f4648b0f5", "ja": "ネトスワの新作は話題になりますからね。\n移動中の電車内で見てみようかな……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "13e2f84df9bc87e4eba3eaee421ad0365eaf9b914f4421832a4854c57fd33fdf", "ja": "あ、今日はこれから社長さんとの\nミーティングでしたね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a8fb065e4cb1e4f4558c5945bab6d1cc79a534639cb5ee52f0baa0398ade8c22", "ja": "そうなんです。\nなので事務所に行かないと……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "d7adc280ccf5cce978b42b8e7b24a98ea4f9a1201e4940f486b106a4467d547d", "ja": "その必要はないよ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e09669706f828241538ce23780469334877679194a4e0f8607bad8a38f9ff9e7", "ja": "えっ！？\nもしかしなくても、この声は……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "82b404c9bbe7bcb30afe5adeabc155d400650cbe6435a0074c70af953a8f3249", "ja": "うおっほん！　もしかしなくても私だよ。\n高木順二朗だ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "4a3276911c934ba0fb9a5bf553fbe3bab57a5b7c223528efbdbbfc9f268d07df", "ja": "私もいますよ♪　{$P$}さん、\n美咲ちゃん、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "0cf200c2a785e30f79d1d003bb39c8138fa39fdd3a9d8cc424d155a372492f7a", "ja": "社長さんに音無先輩！\nおふたり揃って、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "c0f73c90403a0c28a5c867bef25d0a3f81123096372e04e49bda66a6d092deff", "ja": "どうしてもいち早く、\n君の耳に入れたいことがあってね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d5bb81ac37140c001cea11fb5ab5e9149bcd7ef86cabbf68ee144bc069e814f6", "ja": "と言いますと……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "3b5a33e4d16964d9411fe7e7e0061ef617cb65f59f13d6de62bf093e1089d76e", "ja": "君は『ネットスワイプス』、通称『ネトスワ』という\nサブスク型コンテンツ配信サービスを知っているかね？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e330ca492d40a9887a2a0d71a6d6926d56cf2f6912e9db49e26786235a064d44", "ja": "はい、もちろん。クオリティの高い作品作りで、\n今や世界中から注目されている配信会社ですよね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "7da51b83ef9edd822f8fc15a36a1b6c8466419ff0bdcd308f15fe3e4eeecb469", "ja": "今も、ちょうどその話をしていたんですよ！\nドラマがとっても面白かったって……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "17f854fefc4e9eb0b4f0a5cfe46d6ae70fecf9dfb5bfbcc9a4e1dc9b8abf33d3", "ja": "あっ。もしかして、小説が原作の、SFドラマかしら？\n今、すごく話題になってるわよね！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "da112fd5e1e6b00d6ff6aa24025648770c1699045c0191eec4afef6c7b7e600d", "ja": "音無先輩……そうなんです！\nとっても面白かったので、オススメです！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "59b4930b43c4d89c7054660f9334ee5df732b42ef67a9d1648282266405b7e1d", "ja": "なら話は早いですね、社長！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "c8d3286ef5ab22fa010d21b98e02105d37527149226c2276561ad94edeac82bd", "ja": "うむ。実はそのネトスワから、765プロに\n単独番組のオファーが来たんだよ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1024_102mis", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "b9625b98be2cb2d944f9086f8542d60c017e8e73b07f8d5e80021031c075b7d2", "ja": "765プロの新曲を軸にした、音楽配信番組を\nネトスワで独占配信させてほしい、との事だ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "a7638f0d7cc4bfb51fa8009c3b886efe626383fd9e9c42cade6436d389d1b71b", "ja": "何だか、先方がものすごく熱心で……。\nもう企画書も送ってきてくれたんですよね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "310924c17039e426591f1d1ca88622b1d012ee596e4492c417b7340cead73001", "ja": "うむ。配信番組のタイトルは……\n『#プレイリスト』だ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "47bcba832494d6ee8d29a00816741fa0aa84e5d418b63586045a4bb0c1b3c44d", "ja": "『#プレイリスト』……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "799d63389e334496f7f8f60c4ab1be0cc440552a3b17e842a170d929c433ac3e", "ja": "そうです！　このシンプルなタイトル、\n海外の番組って感じですよね～！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "bbcd152fa030f5530c0ea160498837a021d8fdaf365f9134bf3b5bf4cdfca411", "ja": "ネトスワは、今ノリに乗っている海外企業だ。\n舵取りを間違えれば飲まれてしまうだろう。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "14e959ed173ff2c1fe692545fb2a680e25f8b6fcbf82733efcf170c0ffadd91d", "ja": "しかし、これが765プロにとって\n大きなチャンスである事も、また事実だ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "23770b3bb957487e09d57830aea2dba65bc3b332481beb4ff1f8456d4b9d5dba", "ja": "そうですね……。\n少し、考える時間をいただいても……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "64e8ea44051b884efc7f9a46f2a1021dd2c5a165595676f77944c02b2e8f133f", "ja": "もちろんだ。\n君の判断を、基本的には尊重するつもりだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "e2467ad375dbfcd5acb42586c113174c3beb0486985dd33fcb982bfa1e2ee919", "ja": "わかりました……！\n持ち帰り、しっかり判断してみます！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "38153dad4af44c06cc820cfabf332b120cf735087c72163e068b00e382368a17", "ja": "（まさか、ネトスワからオファーとは……。\nしっかり企画書を読み込んで、判断しよう！）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
